   <div class=\"grid-items\">\n                                  <div class=\"grid-item grid-item-416-1-1-1\">\n                    <div class=\"module module-blocks module-blocks-417 blocks-tabs\">\n    <div class=\"module-body\">\n                <div class=\"tabs-container\">\n      <ul class=\"nav nav-tabs\">\n                  <li class=\"tab-2 active\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-1\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Description</a>\n                      </li>\n                  <li class=\"tab-4\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Product Table</a>\n                      </li>\n                  <li class=\"tab-5\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-3\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Video</a>\n                      </li>\n                  <li class=\"tab-6\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-4\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Review</a>\n                      </li>\n              </ul>\n      <div class=\"tab-content\">\n                              <div class=\"module-item module-item-2 tab-pane active\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-1\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-description\">\n                <p></p><h2>Hikvision Cat 6 Ethernet Cable – Orange&nbsp;</h2>The Hikvision Cat 6 UTP Ethernet Cable (Orange) is a high-performance copper network cable engineered for reliable and efficient data transmission. Ideal for surveillance systems, office networks, and high-speed internet connections, this cable delivers stable gigabit Ethernet performance and supports Power over Ethernet (PoE). The bright orange PVC sheath allows for easy cable identification and management in structured cabling installations.<p></p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features:</h3><ul><li>Category: Cat 6 UTP (Unshielded Twisted Pair)</li><li>Conductor Material: Solid bare copper (99.95% purity)</li><li>Conductor Diameter: 0.55 ± 0.005 mm (23 AWG)</li><li>Insulation: High-Density Polyethylene (HDPE)</li><li>Insulation Diameter: 0.98 ± 0.05 mm</li><li>Sheath Material: PVC (Polyvinyl Chloride)</li><li>Outer Diameter: 6.00 ± 0.30 mm</li><li>Sheath Thickness: 0.50 ± 0.10 mm</li><li>Sheath Color: Orange</li><li>Rip Cord: Yes</li><li>Central Separator: Yes (enhances crosstalk resistance)</li><li>Operating Voltage: 60V</li><li>Temperature Range: -20°C to +75°C</li><li>Flame Retardant: No (non-fire-resistant version)</li><li>Compliance Standards: ANSI/TIA-568-C.2, ISO/IEC 11801, RoHS 2.0</li><li>Electrical Performance:</li><li>Bandwidth: Up to 250 MHz</li><li>Data Transmission Speed: Up to 1 Gbps</li><li>Impedance: 100 ± 15 ohms (≤100 MHz), 100 ± 25 ohms (100–250 MHz)</li><li>DC Resistance: ≤ 9.38 ohms per 100 meters</li><li>DC Resistance Unbalance: ≤ 5.0%</li><li>Delay Skew: ≤ 45 ns per 100 meters</li></ul><p><br></p><h3>Applications:</h3><p>IP CCTV systems</p><p>PoE (Power over Ethernet) devices</p><p>Routers, switches, patch panels</p><p>Data centers and enterprise networks</p><p>Home or office structured cabling</p>\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-4 tab-pane no-expand\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-dynamic\">\n                           \n\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-5 tab-pane no-expand\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-3\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-dynamic\">\n                    \n\n\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n        